TCVN_CS_OPENING</Text><Enum>3</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The camera controller is establishing the connection to the camera. ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>TCVN_CS_OPENED</Text><Enum>4</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The connection to the camera has been established and the camera controller is ready to start the image acquisition. ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>TCVN_CS_STARTACQUISITION</Text><Enum>5</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The camera controller is starting the image acquisition. ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>TCVN_CS_ACQUIRING</Text><Enum>6</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The camera is sending images (either streaming or manually triggered, depending on the configuration). ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>TCVN_CS_STOPACQUISITION</Text><Enum>7</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The camera controller is stopping the image acquisition. ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>TCVN_CS_RESETTINGFEATURES</Text><Enum>8</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The camera controller is resetting the features on the camera. ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>TCVN_CS_TRIGGERING</Text><Enum>9</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The camera controller is processing a softwaretrigger. ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>TCVN_CS_CLOSING</Text><Enum>10</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The camera controller is closing the connection to the camera. ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><Properties><Property><Name>Namespace</Name><Value>Tc3_Vision</Value></Property></Properties></DataType><DataType><Name GUID="{DD112102-C23A-4B37-A43A-A96400B57010}" Namespace="VN">TcVnArray8_LREAL</Name><Comment><![CDATA[Eight-dimensional array of element-type LREAL.]]></Comment><BitSize>512</BitSize><BaseType GUID="{18071995-0000-0000-0000-00000000000E}">LREAL</BaseType><ArrayInfo><LBound>0</LBound><Elements>8</Elements></ArrayInfo></DataType><DataType><Name GUID="{E157680C-3577-4579-BB71-A51E5EBFDD63}">GVSP_PIXEL_FORMAT</Name><Comment><![CDATA[Shows the GVSP (GigE Vision Streaming Protocol) pixel format.]]></Comment><BitSize>32</B